---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const updated = "June 1, 2025";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — GPA Calculator Free"
  description="Terms of service for GPA Calculator Free. Calculator results are estimates for educational purposes only."
  canonical="/terms-of-service"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <nav class="breadcrumb mb-4"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Terms of Service</span></nav>
      <h1 class="mb-3">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--color-mute)">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose">
    <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>By accessing and using GPA Calculator Free ("the Site"), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use this site.</p>

    <h2>Educational Purpose & Disclaimer</h2>
    <p><strong>Important:</strong> GPA Calculator Free provides GPA calculations for informational and educational purposes only. Results are estimates based on standard 4.0 scale conventions.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Calculator results may differ from your official GPA as calculated by your school or university.</li>
      <li>Different institutions use different grading scales, plus/minus conventions, and GPA calculation methods.</li>
      <li>Always verify your official GPA through your school's registrar, student portal, or academic advisor.</li>
      <li>Do not make important academic or financial decisions based solely on results from this calculator.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Free Service</h2>
    <p>GPA Calculator Free is provided at no cost to users. We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue the service at any time without notice.</p>

    <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>All content on this site — including text, design, code, and graphics — is owned by GPA Calculator Free and protected by copyright law. You may not reproduce or redistribute content without written permission, except for personal, non-commercial use.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>GPA Calculator Free is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages arising from use of this service, including but not limited to academic consequences, financial decisions, or errors in calculator results.</p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>This site may display advertisements served by third parties including Google AdSense. We are not responsible for the content of third-party advertisements.</p>

    <h2>Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these Terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
